-- 鎶婂鍔辨弿杩伴瑙ｆ瀽鎴愬睘鎬?鐗╁搧/鐗规畩鏁堟灉锛岀晫闈晶鍙洿鎺ユ秷璐广€?local function getRewardCache(detail)
    if not detail then
        return {attrs = {}, items = {}, special = {}, title = nil, realm_exp = 0}
    end
    if detail._reward_cache then
        return detail._reward_cache
    end

    local cfg = {attrs = {}, items = {}, special = {}, title = nil, realm_exp = 0}
    for _, part in ipairs(splitRewardText(detail.reward)) do
        local itemName, itemNum = string.match(part, "^(.-)%*(%d+)$")
        if itemName and itemNum then
            cfg.items[#cfg.items + 1] = {itemName, toNumber(itemNum, 1)}
        elseif string.find(part, "^绉板彿锛?) then
            cfg.title = string.gsub(part, "^绉板彿锛?, "")
        elseif string.find(part, "瀹濈") then
            cfg.items[#cfg.items + 1] = {part, 1}
        else
            local value = string.match(part, "^涔嬪悗浠讳綍寮哄寲鏈?%d+)%%鍑犵巼涓嶆秷鑰楅亾鍏?")
            if value then
                addSpecialValue(cfg.special, "strength_free", rewardPercentValue(value))
            else
                local atkMin, atkMax = string.match(part, "^鏀诲嚮%+(%d+)%-(%d+)$")
                if atkMin and atkMax then
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 3, atkMin)
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 4, atkMax)
                else
                    value = string.match(part, "^鏀诲嚮%+(%d+)$") or string.match(part, "^鏀诲嚮鍔?+(%d+)$") or string.match(part, "^鍥哄畾鏀诲嚮%+(%d+)$")
                    if value then
                        addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 4, value)
                    end
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^鏀婚瓟閬?+(%d+)$")
                if value then
                    for _, attrId in ipairs({3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8}) do
                        addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, attrId, value)
                    end
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^鐢熷懡鍊?+(%d+)$") or string.match(part, "^鍥哄畾鐢熷懡%+(%d+)$")
                if value then
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 1, value)
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^鍥哄畾榄旀硶%+(%d+)$")
                if value then
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 2, value)
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^淇负%+(%d+)$")
                if value then
                    cfg.realm_exp = toNumber(value, 0)
                end

                local defMin, defMax = string.match(part, "^闃插尽%+(%d+)%-(%d+)$")
                if defMin and defMax then
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 8, defMin)
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 9, defMax)
                else
                    value = string.match(part, "^闃插尽%+(%d+)$")
                    if value then
                        addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 9, value)
                    end
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^瀵规€垏鍓?+(.+)$") or string.match(part, "^鎵撴€垏鍓?+(.+)$")
                if value then
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 244, parseBigNum(value))
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^瀵规€浐瀹氬惛琛€%+(%d+)$")
                if value then
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 248, value)
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^鎬墿鏍兼尅%+(%d+)$")
                if value then
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 255, value)
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^姝讳骸鐖嗚姒傜巼%-(%d+)%%$")
                if value then
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, 33, rewardPercentValue(value))
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^浜虹紭%+(%d+)$")
                if value then
                    addSpecialValue(cfg.special, "popularity", value)
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^榄呭姏%+(%d+)$")
                if value then
                    addSpecialValue(cfg.special, "charm", value)
                end

                local attrName, attrValue = string.match(part, "^(.-)%+(%d+)%%$")
                if attrName and attrValue and REWARD_PERCENT_ATTR[attrName] then
                    addAttrValue(cfg.attrs, REWARD_PERCENT_ATTR[attrName], rewardPercentValue(attrValue))
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^鍙楀埌浼ゅ%+(%d+)%%$")
                if value then
                    addSpecialValue(cfg.special, "hurt_taken_up", rewardPercentValue(value))
                end

                value = string.match(part, "^瀵硅法鏈嶆€墿棰濆澧炰激%+(%d+)%%$")
                if value then
                    addSpecialValue(cfg.special, "cross_mon_damage_up", rewardPercentValue(value))
                end
